  "visit.house_rules": {
   "v": [
    "【Morning Service】",
    "Available from opening until 11:30 AM.",
    "Enjoy a delightful set with plenty to eat for just a coin (excluding tax), which also includes coffee! The \"Weekly Morning\" features a variety of dishes to brighten your morning, including tuna rice bowl, shirasu rice bowl, and hot dogs.",
    "【Lunch Service】",
    "Weekdays from 11:00 AM to 3:00 PM.",
    "Our regular menu starts at 880 yen, including unlimited coffee and tea! We offer a range of nostalgic dishes like Napolitan pasta and chicken rice, as well as hearty options like pork ginger and hamburgers. For our daily lunch specials, please check our website.",
    "【Notice】",
    "All seats in our establishment have internet access available, but please be aware that connection issues may occur depending on your device's settings. Thank you for your understanding."
